 case got here","paragraphs":["The Supreme Court heard oral argument in this case on April 25, 2022."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 11-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 11-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 67, lines 27-51","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 67, lines 27-51"}]},{"heading":"What each side wants","paragraphs":["Nance wants to use federal habeas petitions to challenge execution methods.","Ward wants to force these challenges into Section 1983 lawsuits."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 34, lines 15-7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 34, lines 15-7"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 23-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 23-9"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 50, lines 27-17","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 50, lines 27-17"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 65, lines 53-25","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 65, lines 53-25"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 92, lines 31-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 92, lines 31-21"}]},{"heading":"What each side says","paragraphs":["Nance argues habeas corpus is the proper vehicle for method-of-execution claims.","Ward argues Section 1983 is the exclusive legal channel for these disputes."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 34, lines 15-7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 34, lines 15-7"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 23-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 23-9"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 50, lines 27-17","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 50, lines 27-17"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 65, lines 53-25","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 65, lines 53-25"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 92, lines 31-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 92, lines 31-21"}]},{"heading":"What the justices asked","paragraphs":["Justice Sotomayor asked if Georgia can change execution methods without altering the sentence.","Justice Sotomayor asked if any legal barrier prevents Georgia from using firing squads."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 10, lines 25-35","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2021/21-439_83j8.pdf","page_label":"file page 10, lines 25-35"},{"eviden